UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription` = '打开英雄建筑师并加载一个 70 级构筑。' WHERE `ID` = 580138 AND `LogDescription` = 'Open the Hero Architect and load a level 70 build.';
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '满级构筑比升级构筑强大得多。在满级时升级你的构筑对于在终局内容中取得成功至关重要。  你可以在英雄建筑师中找到许多终局就绪的构筑。按 N，然后点击英雄建筑师标签页，然后根据你当前等级选择 60 级或 70 级构筑。  你可以滚动浏览高评分终局构筑，找到一个符合你玩法的！   终局构筑依赖神秘附魔。每个构筑都会在构筑页面底部显示所需的神秘附魔。你应该立即获取建议的传说和史诗附魔，以确保构筑按预期运作，然后尽快寻找蓝色和绿色附魔。  强烈建议你在尝试创建自己的终局构筑之前先试用精选构筑。你也可以在创建自己的构筑时参考高评分构筑，以强大基础起步。  一旦你选择了一个构筑并开始对它感到舒适，不要害怕尝试和调整构筑以适应你的特定玩法。' WHERE `ID` = 580138 AND `QuestDescription` = 'Max level builds are significantly more powerful than leveling builds. It''s vital that you upgrade your build at max level to succeed in end-game content.  You can find many end-game ready builds in the Hero Architect. Hit N, then click the Hero Architect Tab, then select either Level 60 or 70 Builds depending on your current level.  You can scroll through high rated end game builds to find one that matches your playstyle!   End-game builds rely on Mystic Enchants. Each build will show the required Mystic Enchants at the bottom of the build page. You should acquire the Legendary and Epic enchants suggested immediately to ensure the build works as intended, then seek out the Blue and Green enchants as soon as possible.  It is highly recommended you try out featured builds before trying to create your own end-game build. You can also reference high rated builds when creating your own to start with a strong foundation.  Once you choose a build and begin to grow comfortable with it, don''t be afraid to experiment and adjust the build to your specific style of play.';
