UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription` = '- 通过重铸、在世界中发现或在拍卖行获得史诗神秘附魔卷轴。  - 拜访一个祭坛并将 3 个史诗神秘附魔保存到你的附魔收藏。' WHERE `ID` = 580142 AND `LogDescription` = '- Acquire Epic Mystic Enchant Scrolls by Reforging, discovering them in the world, or the Auction House.  - Visit an Altar and save 3 Epic Mystic Enchants to your Enchant Collection.';
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '将 3 个史诗附魔保存到你的收藏。你可以重铸卷轴，直到获得你想保存的史诗附魔，或者在拍卖行搜索能增强你法术和天赋的附魔！  拜访一个祭坛并从卷轴标签页选择一个史诗神秘卷轴，然后点击保存到收藏。如果你没有神秘萃取物，在祭坛重铸神秘卷轴以获得它们。  史诗神秘附魔为你的构筑解锁不可思议的力量。它们可以授予全新的技能并极大地增强你现有的技能。' WHERE `ID` = 580142 AND `QuestDescription` = 'Save 3 Epic Enchants into your collection. You can Reforge Scrolls until you acquire an Epic Enchant you''d like to save, or search the Auction House for Enchants that empower your spells and talents!  Visit an Altar and select an Epic Mystic Scroll from the Scrolls tab, then hit Save to Collection. If you do not have Mystic Extracts, reforge Mystic Scrolls at the altar to acquire them.  Epic Mystic Enchants unlock incredible power for your builds. They can grant entire new abilities and massively empower your existing abilities.';
