UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription` = '- 通过重铸、在世界中发现或在拍卖行获得传说神秘附魔卷轴。  - 拜访一个祭坛并将一个传说神秘附魔保存到你的附魔收藏。' WHERE `ID` = 580143 AND `LogDescription` = '- Acquire a Legendary Mystic Enchant Scroll by Reforging, discovering them in the world, or the Auction House.  - Visit an Altar and save a Legendary Mystic Enchants to your Enchant Collection.';
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '将一个传说附魔保存到你的收藏。你可以重铸卷轴，直到获得你想保存的传说附魔，或者在拍卖行搜索能增强你法术和天赋的附魔！  拜访一个祭坛并从卷轴标签页选择一个传说神秘卷轴，然后点击保存到收藏。如果你没有神秘萃取物，在祭坛重铸神秘卷轴以获得它们。  传说神秘附魔解锁改变游戏的力量。它们可以解锁全新的原型，完全改变你的玩法，并为你的英雄授予巨大的力量提升。' WHERE `ID` = 580143 AND `QuestDescription` = 'Save a Legendary Enchant into your collection. You can Reforge Scrolls until you acquire a Legendary Enchant you''d like to save, or search the Auction House for Enchants that empower your spells and talents!  Visit an Altar and select a Legendary Mystic Scroll from the Scrolls tab, then hit Save to Collection. If you do not have Mystic Extracts, reforge Mystic Scrolls at the altar to acquire them.  Legendary Mystic Enchants unlock game-changing power. They can unlock entirely new archetypes, change the way you play entirely, and grant a massive power boost to your Hero.';
