UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '打开地下城查找器并排队随机史诗地下城，或在指定地下城下选择任意可用的史诗地下城。  史诗地下城比英雄地下城更具挑战性。  在尝试史诗地下城之前，你必须拥有全套 PvE 装备和准备充分的构筑。  装备你的 PvE 装备并击败任意史诗地下城的最终首领！' WHERE `ID` = 580147 AND `QuestDescription` = 'Open the Dungeon Finder and queue for a Random Mythic Dungeon or pick any of the available Mythic Dungeons under Specific Dungeons.  Mythic Dungeons are more challenging than Heroic Dungeons.   It is essential that you have full PvE gear and a well-prepared build before attempting a Mythic Dungeon.  Equip your PvE gear and defeat the final boss of any Mythic Dungeon!';
