UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '收集神秘附魔并扩展你的附魔收藏会给你更多选择和更多力量。  你可以保存到附魔收藏的神秘附魔数量没有限制。你会继续通过重铸获得神秘萃取物，通过完成各种内容获得，也可以从召唤板旁的 Nozdormu 处以金币或飞升印记购买。  将 10 个神秘附魔保存到你的收藏。' WHERE `ID` = 580169 AND `QuestDescription` = 'Collecting Mystic Enchants and expanding your Enchant Collection will give you more options and more power.  There is no limit to the number of Mystic Enchants you can save to your Enchant Collection. You will continue earning Mystic Extracts from reforging Reforging, earned by completing various content, and can be bought from Nozdormu next to the Call Board for Gold or Marks of Ascension.  Save 10 Mystic Enchants to your collection.';
