UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '拜访你阵营主城拍卖行中的 提拉希斯 以查看虚灵集市的商品。  虚灵集市出售限量库存的随机外观物品、法术和坐骑。提拉希斯 每天从数千种外观物品池中随机多次更新他的库存。提拉希斯 上总有新东西可以发现，你甚至可能是第一个发现某个特定外观物品的玩家！  当 提拉希斯 更新库存时，只有一个玩家可以购买某件外观物品。当你从 提拉希斯 购买一件物品时，其他人在它再次被随机选入他的库存之前都无法获得该物品。  与 提拉希斯 交谈并用集市代币购买任意物品。你可以从拍卖行获得集市代币！' WHERE `ID` = 580173 AND `QuestDescription` = 'Visit Tiraxis in your faction''s capital Auction House to view the Ethereal Bazaar wares.  The Ethereal Bazaar sells a limited stock of random Vanity items, spells and mounts. Tiraxis updates his inventory randomly multiple times per day from a pool of thousands of vanity items. There is always something new to discover on Tiraxis, and you may even be the first player to find a specific Vanity Item!  Only one player can buy a Vanity Item when Tiraxis updates his stock. When you buy an item form Tiraxis, no one else will be able to acquire that item until it is randomly selected in his stock again.  Talk to Tiraxis and purchase any item for Bazaar tokens. You can obtain Bazaar tokens from the Auction House!';
