UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '头等实验传送器让你可以迅速从主城前往世界或其他主城。  该传送器位于主城的繁华区域，它很显眼，你不会错过它。  你会被抛到数百码高的空中，别担心，我们提供了一个降落伞，持续时间刚好够你……安全着陆。' WHERE `ID` = 580174 AND `QuestDescription` = 'The First Class Experimental Teleporter allows you to get from the Capital City into the World or into other capital cities in a jiffy.  This Teleporter is located in popular parts of the Capital Cities, it stands out and you won''t miss it.  You will be dropped hundreds of yards into the air, don''t worry, we provide a parachute that lasts just long enough to get you to the ground... safely.';
