UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = '飞升之路：使用你的神秘附魔收藏' WHERE `ID` = 580182 AND `LogTitle` = 'Path to Ascension: Using Your Mystic Enchant Collection';
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription` = '拜访一个祭坛，并将你附魔收藏中的一个神秘附魔应用到一个激活附魔槽位。' WHERE `ID` = 580182 AND `LogDescription` = 'Visit an Altar and apply a Mystic Enchant from your Enchant Collection to an Active Enchant slot.';
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '从神秘祭坛打开附魔收藏标签页，从你的附魔收藏中选择一个附魔并将其应用到一个激活附魔槽位，然后选择保存更改以激活你的神秘附魔。  从你的收藏中激活附魔需要神秘宝珠，可以通过召唤板上的日常任务、地下城和团队副本、战场，或在世界中击败敌人获得！  1 个传说附魔可以应用到祭坛中最大的中央槽位。  3 个史诗附魔可以应用到内环的中型槽位。  你可以在剩余槽位中应用任意数量的稀有和精良附魔。其中许多附魔最多可以叠加 3 次。将鼠标悬停在收藏中的附魔上会显示其最大叠加数。' WHERE `ID` = 580182 AND `QuestDescription` = 'Open the Enchant Collection tab from a Mystic Altar, select an Enchant from your Enchant Collections and apply it to an Active Enchant slot, then select Save Changes to activate your Mystic Enchant.  Activating Enchants from your collection requires Mystic Orbs, which can be earned from Daily Quests on the Call Board, Dungeons and Raids, Battlegrounds or defeating enemies in the world!  1 Legendary Enchant can be applied to the large center slot in the Altar.  3 Epic Enchants can be applied in the medium slots in the inner ring.  You can apply as many Rare and Uncommon Enchants in the remaining slots as you''d like. Many of these Enchants can stack up to 3 times. Mousing over the Enchant in the collection reveals its max stack size.';
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestCompletionLog` = '返回召唤板。' WHERE `ID` = 580182 AND `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Return to the Call Board.';
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = '飞升之路：转生' WHERE `ID` = 580183 AND `LogTitle` = 'Path to Ascension: Prestige';
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription` = '如果你想转生，请与主城召唤板旁的 克罗米 交谈。这会将你重置到 1 级！如果你不想转生，可以放弃此任务。' WHERE `ID` = 580183 AND `LogDescription` = 'Talk to Chromie next to the Call Board in your capital city if you would like to Prestige. This will reset you to level 1! You can abandon this quest if you do not want to Prestige.';
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '选择转生会将你的角色重置到 1 级，并将你传送到起始区域。  转生是获得装备、神秘附魔材料、飞升印记等的好方法！带着你已获得的所有知识重新体验升级旅程、地下城和战场，包括你保存的神秘附魔！  会发生什么：  - 你当前的专精会被重置。 - 你装备的装备会邮寄给你。 - 所有升级任务会被重置并可以再次完成。 - 你的任务日志会被清空。  在 外卡 中转生会重置你当前选择的专精！    你当前的 外卡 专精将会： - 遗忘所有法术和天赋。这会重置你的激活构筑！ - 移除该专精的命运卷轴。 - 重置 Silas 处该专精的命运卷轴任务。 - 移除命运宝箱。 - 所有其他专精将保持锁定，直到你达到满级。 - 你可以为你的转生专精激活新的技能卡。 - 你装备的装备会邮寄给你。 - 所有升级任务会被重置并可以再次完成。 - 你的任务日志会被清空。  你将保留所有专业、装备、飞升印记、货币和物品，除了你转生专精的未使用命运之手。如果你已学习高级骑术训练，你会收到一本宝典，允许你在适当等级重新学习骑术。' WHERE `ID` = 580183 AND `QuestDescription` = 'Choosing to Prestige will reset your character to level 1 and teleport you to your starting zone.  Prestige is a great way to earn gear, Mystic Enchanting supplies, Marks of Ascension and more! Re-experience the leveling journey, Dungeons and Battlegrounds with all the knowledge you have acquired, including your saved Mystic Enchants!  What happens:  - Your current specialization is reset. - Your equipped gear will be mailed to you. - All leveling quests will be reset and available to be completed again. - Your quest log will be wiped.  Prestiging in Wildcard resets your currently selected specialization!    Your current Wildcard Specialization will: - Unlearn all spells and talents. This resets your active build! - Removes Scrolls of Fortune for that specialization. - Resets Scroll of Fortune quests at Silas for that specialization. - Removes Cases of Fortune. - All other Specs will remain locked until you reach max level. - You can activate new Skill Cards for your Prestiged Spec. - Your equipped gear will be mailed to you. - All leveling quests will be reset and available to be completed again. - Your quest log will be wiped.  You will keep all professions, gear, Marks of Ascension, currencies and items except for your Prestiged Spec''s Unspent Hand of Fates. If you have advanced riding training you will receive a tome that will allow you to relearn your riding at the appropriate level.';
