UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription` = '- 通过击败敌人或与其他玩家交易获得一个神秘附魔卷轴。  - 与你的主城中或世界中发现的神秘附魔祭坛互动，并选择附魔卷轴标签页。  - 激活一个神秘卷轴并将其应用到一个激活附魔槽位。' WHERE `ID` = 1903513 AND `LogDescription` = '- Obtain a Mystic Enchanting Scroll by defeating enemies or trading other players.  - Interact with a Mystic Enchanting Altar found in your Capital City or in the World and select Enchant Scrolls tab.  - Activate a Mystic Scroll and apply it to an Active Enchant slot.';
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '神秘附魔卷轴可以通过击败敌人、在世界各处隐藏地点发现，或与其他玩家交易获得。   一旦获得，前往神秘附魔祭坛应用神秘卷轴以获得其力量！神秘附魔祭坛经常被召唤在主城中，或者你可以前往世界中去拜访一个。它们的位置标记在世界地图上。    神秘附魔是解锁你作为英雄力量的关键。寻找能增强你法术或解锁全新原型的神秘附魔，以提升你的力量。' WHERE `ID` = 1903513 AND `QuestDescription` = 'Mystic Enchanting Scrolls can be obtained by defeating enemies, found hidden throughout the world, or by trading other players.    Once obtained, visit a Mystic Enchanting Altar to apply a Mystic Scroll to gain its powers! Mystic Enchanting Altars can often be found summoned in Capital Cities, or you can venture into the world to visit one. Their locations are marked on the world map.    Mystic Enchants are key to unlocking your power as a Hero. Find Mystic Enchants that empower your spells or unlock whole new archetypes to increase your power.';
