UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '按 N，或点击小地图旁的卷轴图标以打开角色进阶菜单。  点击菜单左下角附近的英雄建筑师标签页。  滚动浏览右侧列表中的各种构筑，找到一个你感兴趣或符合你职业幻想的。你可以随时更改你的构筑，所以尽情挑选一个吸引你的吧。如果构筑不符合你的玩法，你可以随时重新选择。  找到一个你想玩的构筑并选择“选择此构筑”以激活它。你会立即学会所有必需的法术和天赋，并随着你升级自动学习法术和天赋！  如果你对 Ascension 有经验，或想从头开始构建你的构筑，你可以选择“不，我想自己选择技能和天赋。”' WHERE `ID` = 1903539 AND `QuestDescription` = 'Hit N, or click the scroll icon by your mini map to open up the Character Advancement Menu.  Click the Hero Architect tab near the bottom left of the menu.  Scroll through the various builds in the list to the right to find one that interests you or fits your class fantasy. You can change your build anytime, so have fun and pick something that stands out to you. If the build does not match your playstyle you can always repick.  Find a build you would like to play and select "Choose This Build" to activate it. You will immediately learn all the required spells and talents, and will automatically learn spells and talents as you level!  If you are experienced with Ascension, or would like to craft your build from scratch, you can select "No, I''d like to pick abilities and talents myself."';
